  - LoRA
  - pre-registration
  - evaluation
abstract: >-
  An empirical variance decomposition and diagnostic audit of a previously published
  +0.0288 severity-weighted recall margin for a 1.7B LoRA fine-tune over a frontier
  model on synthetic financial reconciliation tasks, isolating training-seed spread,
  single-class memorization, prompt and decode-budget confounds, trivial floors, and
  validation-loss decoupling. Code is Apache-2.0, the paper CC BY 4.0.
